 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:6;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes'>
  <td width=256 valign=top style='width:153.5pt;border:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;
  border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;mso-border-alt:
  dotted windowtext .25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black;
  font-style:normal'>87 inci Fasılda yer alan taşıtların koltuk ve seleleri<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=256 valign=top style='width:153.55pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;
  mso-border-top-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;mso-border-left-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;
  mso-border-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black;
  font-style:normal'>Motorlu kara nakil vasıtalarının (<a
  data-tooltip='87#p01' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/tarife_ve_izahname/izahname/fasil_metinleri/87.htm#p01">87.01</a>
  ila 87.05 tarife pozisyonları) koltukları <a
  data-tooltip='94#p01' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/tarife_ve_izahname/izahname/fasil_metinleri/94.htm#p01">9401</a>.20,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black;
  font-style:normal'><a
  data-tooltip='87#p11' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/tarife_ve_izahname/izahname/fasil_metinleri/87.htm#p11">87.11</a>
  tarife pozisyonunda yer alan motorsiklet koltukları <a
  data-tooltip='87#p14' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/tarife_ve_izahname/izahname/fasil_metinleri/87.htm#p14">8714</a>.10.90.00.19<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black;
  font-style:normal'><a
  data-tooltip='87#p12' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/tarife_ve_izahname/izahname/fasil_metinleri/87.htm#p12">87.12</a>
  ve <a
  data-tooltip='87#p13' target='_blank' href="https://www.gumrukkulliyati.com/index.php?id=docs/gumruk_mevzuati/dosyalar/tarife_ve_izahname/izahname/fasil_metinleri/87.htm#p13">87.13</a>
  tarife pozisyonunda yer alan taşıtların koltuk ve seleleri 8714.95<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=256 valign=top style='width:153.55pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:dotted windowtext 1.0pt;
  mso-border-top-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;mso-border-left-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;
  mso-border-alt:dotted windowtext .25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black;
  font-style:normal'>GYK (1), (6)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black;
  font-style:normal'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black;
  font-style:normal'>94 üncü fasıl 1-h no.lu not<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black;
  font-style:normal'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none'><span
